(7415097, 1168863, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very natural color and especially the yellow with good impact contrasted as it is against the rest. To me this has more potential which I think could be realized by a crop from the top and right to bring the upper right flower to the center line or possibly even tighter.</td>', 'Very natural color and especially the yellow with good impact contrasted as it is against the rest. To me this has more potential which I think could be realized by a crop from the top and right to bring the upper right flower to the center line or possibly even tighter.', '2015-11-08 23:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415098, 1169196, 115814, '<td valign="top">I imagine you''ll take a beating score-wise on this. But it''s a bold entry in my book. Thanks for making me smile and see yellow in an unorthodox manner. I hereby grant you the monochrome version of the POLM - Pointless Order of the Liquid Mind. Take it FWIW. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1166207" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166207.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166207.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166207.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I imagine you''ll take a beating score-wise on this. But it''s a bold entry in my book. Thanks for making me smile and see yellow in an unorthodox manner. I hereby grant you the monochrome version of the POLM - Pointless Order of the Liquid Mind. Take it FWIW. ', '2015-11-08 23:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
