(7415279, 1169223, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sugarbear:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved this one for the yellow challenge. Where did you shoot this??? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=90154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sugarbear</a> this is at the Crayola Factory in Easton, PA.  The entire back entrance is painted like this.  Here''s a Google street view image.  I love that they actually pixelated the faces of one crayon and one marker.  Not all, just one each.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1169632" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169632.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169632.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1169632.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by sugarbear: I loved this one for the yellow challenge. Where did you shoot this???    sugarbear this is at the Crayola Factory in Easton, PA.  The entire back entrance is painted like this.  Here''s a Google street view image.  I love that they actually pixelated the faces of one crayon and one marker.  Not all, just one each. ', '2015-11-09 16:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
